# Set HOST to the machine's IP or hostname when running on another machine.
# Examples:
#   HOST=localhost          (local development - default)
#   HOST=192.168.1.42       (another machine on the same network)
#   HOST=myserver.local     (hostname-based)
# After changing HOST, delete ./certs/ so new SSL certs are generated for the new host.
# Also update GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI and FORTYTWO_REDIRECT_URI to match, and register
# the new URLs in the Google / 42 OAuth app consoles.
